  "pet_notes": "Compact full-body chibi Hoshimi Miyabi. Very tall dark fox ears with gray inner fur, straight dark navy-black bangs, long connected dark hair mass, vivid red eyes, calm serious expression. Teal-green haori-style jacket over white collared shirt and black tie, black pleated skirt, dark tights and boots. Character-left arm (viewer-right when front-facing) has black mechanical armor and a red braided cord; character-right side has the teal sleeve. A compact sheathed katana remains rigidly attached at the hip with no floating tassels. Preserve costume sides and ear shape. Simplify tiny badges and never render readable text, logos, watermarks, detached petals, ice, flames, speed lines, glows, shadows, or scenery.",
